WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.540
Trump says Governor J.B. Pritzker and Mayor Brandon Johnson should be in jail.

00:06.160 --> 00:11.220
ICE officers' lives are in danger in Chicago, and at this point, they're aiding and abetting an insurrection.

00:12.080 --> 00:15.300
This is nothing more than sabotage and a dereliction of duty.

00:15.680 --> 00:19.260
But the mayor says Trump's just trying to lock up another brother.

00:19.820 --> 00:28.820
It's certainly not the first time that Donald Trump has called for the arresting of a black man unjustly.

00:28.820 --> 00:31.520
I'm not going anywhere. I'm going to stay firm.

00:32.100 --> 00:35.800
Johnson's not very bright. Trump also wants to lock up the white guy.

00:36.320 --> 00:38.420
But the white guy's building a wall.

00:39.200 --> 00:45.220
This is a convicted felon. I mean, think about that. Who is threatening to jail me.

00:46.220 --> 00:50.740
I got to say, this guy's unhinged. He's insecure. He's a wannabe dictator.

00:51.240 --> 00:54.340
And there's one thing I really want to say to Donald Trump.

00:54.560 --> 00:58.780
If you come for my people, you come through me. So come and get me.

00:58.820 --> 01:04.120
Jamie backs big, but he's not that big. How's ribs going to stop a chopper?

